    "enUS": {
      "description": "Greetings, warrior.  Your skill grows, but there is more to your profession than you may believe.  To further progress, you must soon find a teacher.\n\nThe warrior Elanaria dwells in Darnassus, at the Warrior's Terrace.  She can instruct you.",
      "summary": "Speak with Elanaria.",
